{
  "title": "Mädels Initiative",
  "language": "DE",
  "slug": "/women",
  "layout": "../layouts/PageLayout.astro",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "hero",
      "title": "Hot Girls ||Build Startups",
      "heroTagline": "Eine Initiative der PionierGarage",
      "image": "/src/assets/women_hero_desktop-1.png",
      "mobileImage": "/src/assets/women_hero_mobile-1.png",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      },
      "titleStyle": {
        "size": "xlarge",
        "color": "accent-pink",
        "alignment": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "20px",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "content": "### Wir schaffen den Raum, in dem die Zukunft Gestalt annimmt.\n\n",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "content": "Die Karlsruher Community für Frauen, die etwas bewegen – und für die Verbündeten, die sie dabei unterstützen.\nHier triffst du Gleichgesinnte, schärfst deine Ideen und lernst Menschen kennen, die ihr Wissen teilen und Türen öffnen. Kein Exklusivitätsgehabe. Keine leeren Empowerment-Floskeln. Sondern echte Kontakte, neue Perspektiven und Raum zum Ausprobieren.",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "100px",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "custom-block",
      "component": "StatsOverview",
      "props": {
        "stats": [
          { "value": 10, "caption": "Aktive Frauen", "suffix": "%" },
          { "value": 30, "caption": "Mitglieder", "suffix": "" },
          { "value": 0, "caption": "Sponsoren", "suffix": "" }
        ]
      },
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "custom-block",
      "component": "TeamGallery",
      "props": {
        "source": "women-team",
        "showContact": false
      },
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      }
    }
  ]
}